# support/

Test helpers and fixtures following the test-highlander principle: setup logic, introspection utilities, and fixture definitions live here once, shared across multiple test suites rather than duplicated.

## Files

- `fence_helpers.ex` -- introspection over project namespaces and module organization for structural assertion fences
- `doc_helpers.ex` -- documentation introspection (moduledocs, examples, typespecs) for doc-conformance fences
- `config_helpers.ex` -- application-environment preconditions, especially default-pipeline module lifecycle
- `cache_helpers.ex` -- cache setup and evaluation-counting spy predicates for cache test suites
- `dsl_fixtures.ex` -- canonical DSL fixture corpus: consumer-side macro module and .pred sources for DSL/macro/loader suites
- `service_fixtures.ex` -- shared test inputs for service and CLI suites: temp files and multi-loop pipeline
- `sia_fixtures.ex` -- pattern layer test inputs: staging and characterisation pipelines and data
